      "id": 130736,
      "name": "svestus",
      "username": "svestus",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/cdc98d/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-02-06T22:41:10.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Reckless\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/reckless/48/2467_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Reckless:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Those are pretty neat! They make quite an impression for only being five seconds each!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I'm glad that comes through. Since these will be part of a trailer, everything will be happening really fast, but I wanted to make sure there was enough detail in each shot so that nerds like myself can take the time and pause each moment to really see it all without having to devote more than a couple seconds to each shot and compromising the flow of the trailer.</p>\n<p>I am also trying to base each moment on an actual card from the game.</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:05:54.995Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
